      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Aññaṁjīvaṁaññaṁsarīraṁsutta ",
      "english": "The soul is one thing, the body another "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
      "english": "At Sāvatthī. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "“Kismiṁ nu kho, bhikkhave, sati, kiṁ upādāya, kiṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, when what exists, because of grasping what and insisting on what, does the view arise: "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "‘aññaṁ jīvaṁ aññaṁ sarīran’”ti? ",
      "english": "‘The soul is one thing, the body another’?” … "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "“Bhagavaṁmūlakā no, bhante, dhammā …pe… ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "niyato sambodhiparāyano”ti. ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
